{
    "background_story": "Jade was a socialite known for her extravagant lifestyle. She spent her inheritance profligately, throwing lavish parties and buying designer clothes and jewelry. Her mansion was a symbol of her opulence, with crystal chandeliers, marble floors, and a collection of rare art pieces. Jade's love for luxury knew no bounds, and she spared no expense in pursuit of her desires. She would often charter private jets to attend exclusive events and stay in the most luxurious suites. However, her reckless spending eventually caught up with her, leaving her on the brink of bankruptcy. As she struggled to come to terms with her financial reality, Jade was forced to confront the consequences of her profligate ways and reevaluate her priorities.",
